Component Required connection
AdvancedCarController 4 Wheel Colliders + 4 wheel meshes
AdvancedCameraFollow Player Transform + Rigidbody
CarAudio Engine AudioClip + car
CarEffects Rear Wheel Colliders + smoke particles
CarLighting Headlights + brake light renderers
MobileInput AdvancedCarController
RaceManager Player car + UI text
If you reuse your previous RaceManager.cs, change its car reference from CarController to AdvancedCarController.
Also:
Add an EventSystem to the scene for touch UI.
Add a Canvas with four touch buttons.
Check that the player car has a Rigidbody and the Player tag.
Ensure all scripts compile before building for Android.
